## Why This Is Asked

Tests ability to design edge-scale supply chain controls and incident response across thousands of devices, including hardware attestation, ephemeral credentials, and cross-region governance.

## Key Concepts

- Edge attestation (TPM/IMA)
- Ephemeral credentials (SPIFFE/SPIRE)
- Reproducible builds and SBOM
- Artifact signing and verification
- Canary deployments and rollback
- Cross-region auditing and incident response

## Code Example

```javascript
// Minimal artifact verification sketch
function verifyArtifact(artifact, signature, sbom) {
  // Verify signature against trusted keys
  if (!verifySignature(signature, artifact)) {
    throw new Error('Invalid signature');
  }

  // Validate SBOM integrity
  if (!validateSBOM(sbom)) {
    throw new Error('Invalid SBOM');
  }

  // Check reproducible build hash
  return verifyReproducibleHash(artifact, sbom);
}
```

## Why This Is Asked

Tests practical cryptographic key management across multiple clouds, data residency, and incident response coordination with real-world entities.

## Key Concepts

- Multi-cloud KMS/HSM integration
- Data residency and cross-border controls
- Key hierarchy and envelope encryption
- Rotation, revocation, and auditability
- ABAC/RBAC enforcement and access logging

## Code Example

```javascript
// Pseudo: rotate region data key
async function rotateRegionKey(region) {
  const regionalKMS = getRegionalKMS(region);
  const newKey = await regionalKMS.generateDataKey({ KeySpec: 'AES_256' });
  await storeDataKey(region, newKey);
  revokeOldKey(region);
}
```

